! Real cFE ES startup script for the PCC Gate + Target reference apps.
!
! Format: CFE_APP, <AppFile>, <EntryPoint>, <AppName>, <Priority>, <StackSize>, <Load Addr>, <Flags>
!
! PCC_GATE_APP MUST start before TARGET_APP so the verifier is subscribed to the raw
! command MID (0x1808) and ready to republish to the verified MID (0x1809) before the
! target app subscribes to receive verified commands — otherwise there is a boot-order
! race where TARGET_APP could miss the first republished command.
!
! This file is not consumed by a live cFE build in this repository (see README.md "NASA
! cFS Integration — Honest Status") — it documents the intended startup ordering for when
! this reference implementation is built against a real cFE instance, and is parsed for
! real by eval/test_boot_order.py rather than being a hardcoded string inside the test.

CFE_APP, PCC_GATE_APP, PCC_GateAppMain, PCC_GATE, 50, 8192, 0x0, 0x0;
CFE_APP, TARGET_APP,   Target_AppMain,  TARGET,   60, 8192, 0x0, 0x0;
